sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Author
  participant B as Browser
  participant N as Next.js server
  participant SA as Supabase Auth
  participant LI as LinkedIn
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres (RLS)
  participant RS as Resend

  A->>B: Click "Write a testimonial"
  B->>N: GET /testimonials/write
  N-->>B: Not signed in -> "Sign in with LinkedIn"
  A->>B: Click sign in
  B->>SA: signInWithOAuth(linkedin_oidc, PKCE)
  SA->>LI: Authorization request (openid profile email)
  LI-->>A: Consent screen
  A->>LI: Allow
  LI-->>SA: Authorization code
  SA-->>B: Redirect to /auth/callback?code=...
  B->>N: GET /auth/callback
  N->>SA: exchangeCodeForSession(code)
  SA-->>N: Session (httpOnly cookies)
  N-->>B: Redirect to form, name prefilled from LinkedIn claim
  A->>B: Fill relationship, headline, URL, text, consent + Turnstile
  B->>N: Server Action submitTestimonial
  N->>N: Zod validation + Turnstile verify + get verified user
  N->>DB: insert (user_id = auth.uid())
  DB->>DB: Trigger sets author_name from LinkedIn metadata, forces status = pending
  alt duplicate (already has one)
    DB-->>N: unique violation
    N-->>B: "You already wrote one — edit it instead"
  else ok
    DB-->>N: row
    N->>RS: Notify Desi (name + 80-char preview + admin link)
    N-->>B: Status: PENDING REVIEW
  end
